{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right","id":1420772,"title":"Villains - Gods and Alt-Right","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-28T22:23:04-07:00","id":1420772,"title":"Villains - Gods and Alt-Right","content":"<b>Notice:</b> We talk here about sensitive topics. Think three times before posting here anything.<br /> <br /> Scion universe is \u2018our Earth with gods\u2019. On our Earth we have Alt-Right, or fascists, groups and factions. I\u2019m interested how would Gods and Titans look on the worshipers from those groups. <b>I emphasize: <i>I mean here to look at possible villains for play. </i></b>Like Nazis in 1930s <a href=\"https://scholarworks.bgsu.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1113&amp;context=irj\" target=\"_blank\">were almost worshipers of Aesir</a>. Modern groups like Greek <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Dawn_(Greece)\" target=\"_blank\">Golden Dawn party, supporting modern version of Spartan society, is promoting worship of Theoi</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T22:35:15-07:00","id":1420773,"title":"","content":"I don't like putting in Nazis in any way associated with the Aesir. Not even as deluded idiots who exist only to eat the fist of an ACTUAL Aesir champion.<br /> <br /> Fuck them. Fuck Nazis, and even putting them in adjacent to this game just to get thrashed feels like I'm being too nice to them. And I'm definitely not putting them in with any occultic powers, because they don't deserve the validation.<br /> <br /> Edit: And adjacent advice: If you DO want to use Nazis in your game? Make them pathetic. Make them weak cowards who exist only to be humiliated.<br /> <br /> Make their prayers to the Aesir unanswered. Make them undone by the actions of your PCs, or by the direct smiting of the Gods they dare dishonor.<br /> <br /> Because, and this cannot be overstated: <b><i>FUCK NAZIS</i></b>. They really don't deserve anything that can be potentially viewed as vindication or validation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 10-29-2020, 01:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":21}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T23:33:03-07:00","id":1420774,"title":"","content":"I would not think it would be impossible for gods to mistakenly grant a request once in a while to hateful, horrible people. It would not exactly be the first time such things happened.<br /> <br /> I would think that many the gods themselves often don't have a good enough grasp of human political ideologies to know what a nazi is compared to a normal person, but on the other hand many of them should have a good ability to read a person's character and motivations for the prayers they are making and therefore know that the prayers and requests that the nazis make are not about the glory of the god or the religion but for the advancement of a hateful and pathetic agenda.<br /> <br /> Many gods are terrible, spiteful characters themselves and so it would not be beneath them to exploit such easy-to-manipulate groups for their own benefit, maybe not through answering prayers but by infiltrating them and tricking them. Especially trickster gods revel in manipulating weak and pathetic humans and many nazis are probably prime targets.<br /> <br /> As for Scions; well, they are still mostly human with a human upbringing so they can of course choose to espouse any and all human ideologies. I shudder at the thought of a neo-nazi Scion. And even if they don't actually hold such beliefs or ideologies I think a manipulative Scion can easily ingratiate themselves as leaders of such hateful groups, just like there exist many leaders today of niche groups such as hate groups or flat-earthers who don't actually believe in the ideology or world-view of the group they are leading but enjoy the power and money that they gain from it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9849,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","user":"Aristarkos","date":". 10-29-2020, 02:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T23:58:25-07:00","id":1420775,"title":"","content":"Beating up Nazis can be fun, and I definitely wouldn\u2019t have the \u00c6sir be in any way supporting of them, \u201cOdin\u2019s the Allfather not the somefather\u201d as the saying goes. Also most gods are not anywhere near as spiteful as you might think, most pantheons consist of rather decent folk, it\u2019s mostly the Theoi or Annunua who are spiteful and even then their spite usually has a reason. I could see some Trickster gods sabotaging those groups although I\u2019d mostly imagine them just mocking them publicly and harshly with their guile. A neo-Nazi Scion would be something I\u2019d be very careful with since that can go really uncomfortable for the player group real fast","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24769-magicjohnny","name":"Magicjohnny","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24769_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T00:18:53-07:00","id":1420780,"title":"","content":"Great, <b>Aristokrotas</b>, now you got me idea - Scion of Loki that is using <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thule_Society\" target=\"_blank\">Thule Society</a> remnants for his own goals, impersonating 'Allfather' ( Odin ) as their patron. Thule's are working as alt-right party think tank in public. Thanks for this idea. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( I use <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1275725-2e-setting-hack-gods-in-hiding-and-new-mythic-age\">'Gods in Hiding' setting hack</a>, so even cults are not sure if particular being is really the god itself. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T00:42:53-07:00","id":1420782,"title":"","content":"I'm currently running a 1E version of Scion where the main bad group is a bunch of neo-Nazis led by a renegade Scion of Odin and a Titanspawn who used to be Hitler. In it, the gods want them GONE because by their actions, they're hastening Ragnarok and NO ONE wants that.<br /> <br /> Needless to say, it's not impossible to run a game where you can punch Nazis and kill Hitler, and considering that the player group is enjoying it a lot, I think it's quite successful. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crazy? I was crazy once. They put me in a home. I died there. Then they buried me. Then the worms came. Worms? I hate worms. They drive me crazy! Crazy? I was crazy once...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4363-charbonne","name":"Charbonne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T00:58:15-07:00","id":1420783,"title":"","content":"I feel like the first and most important detail is making sure the players are fine with this. You know seeing how in some areas these might not have the same disconnect from the player group that fighting the Nazis in WW2 would and you know rule one and all that.<br /> <br /> As for the actual groups I would honestly check and see how they fit any sort of veneration for a pantheon into things. If they actually follow principles, rules, and traditions of the religion then maybe the Pantheon might be willing to work with them, especially if in setting they're more like actual followers than just people claiming a pantheon. IE My limited knowledge of the Golden Dawn it feels like any veneration for the Theoi is less genuine belief, appreciation for teachings, comfort with the guidelines, and more just that they view the Theoi as Greek Gods and therefore should be the only allowed religion instead of condoning the presence of one's that aren't Greek.<br /> <br /> Like nothing in my knowledge of the Nazi's suggest the Aesir would have any fondness for them since the stuff I've seen puts more that they used the symbols to insist the vikings* were part of their Aryan race and thus why they were superior to all others.Then of course there was the book of &quot;secret runes&quot; which was used to alter meaning of various runes and symbols associated with the Aesir into things more appropriate the nazis.<br /> <br /> I mean if they came up in game and associated themselves with things that's a possibility, but I just don't see them getting a lot of support from the Aesir existing in modern time frames without hoops being jumped through. Hoops that I'm also just not interested in jumping through because well I lack the respect or interest in groups like the Nazis to put those hoops in game. Especially when I can do something more interesting things like the cult trying to get Jormgundr to go after the sun because one of them wants to pull a kill and replace on Thor and Thor is famously to die seven steps after his fight with the world serpent. Or Nemetondevos Scions and their followers going after Roman incarnations of the Theoi (why they might be willing to draw the line at hunting Mars and his followers but not Ares and Ares followers despite them being acknowledged as the same entity is a mystery for the game) in retribution for the whole Ceasar trying to wipe them out thing.<br /> <br /> *A fun note I've seen in a few places is that the word viking was closer to an occupation, though one listed as a verb, than a the culture/nationality identifier it tends to be used as.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T02:20:47-07:00","id":1420789,"title":"","content":"I agree that Nazi villains can totally work, but I would personally be one of those players who'd vehemently veto that for my own group. I hear too much of Nazis in my day-to-day life, I'd like to at least keep them out of my hobbies. I also think that giving Nazis magical powers or magical origins can have seriously bad implications (I already discussed this on another thread a while ago, the post is here if anyone's interested: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/963787-great-scions-of-history?p=964859#post964859\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...859#post964859</a> ). One has to be very careful not to imply that Nazism, racism, White Supremacy etc. are problems of non-human, supernatural origin that can simply be solved with a quick spell. There are certainly ways to productively include Nazis in a Fantasy setting, but it's a task I don't feel up for either as a storyteller or player.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10624-sacerdos","name":"Sacerdos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10624_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"231"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T05:16:16-07:00","id":1420802,"title":"","content":"Be careful. Some players may not be comfortable with this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T05:21:37-07:00","id":1420803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420802#post1420802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Be careful. Some players may not be comfortable with this.</div> </div> </div> </div>I run game on <b>Discord </b>- and made special channel on our server for consent and game health issues. #Game-<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Occupational_safety_and_health\" target=\"_blank\">OSH</a><br /> I already mentioned the planed issue before to all my player - half of them already said in favour of it. We will see.<br /> <br /> But I started topic even to make general talk about Alt-Right idea in <b>Scion</b> universe, either way\u2026","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-29-2020, 08:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T06:48:00-07:00","id":1420811,"title":"","content":"<b>Note: vast generalizations ahead that will not stand up to academic scrutiny</b><br /> <br /> I'm going to start with some basic premises:<br /> <br /> 1. People are drawn to these movements because they feel powerless politically, socially, or economically.<br /> 2. They look at an idealized, imaginary version of history to prove to themselves that they were once strong.<br /> 3. They blame outside influences for &quot;corrupting&quot; their society and causing it to lose that past strength.<br /> 4. They believe that if they remove those influences, they will become strong again.<br /> <br /> Because their explanation for their current situation is flawed \u2014 based on a history that was never as perfect as they pretend, and blaming cultural changes on an easily identifiable group of malicious outsiders rather than complex historical forces \u2014 they are always doomed to fail. Even if they make some progress toward &quot;purifying&quot; their society, the fact that it doesn't solve all of their problems forces them to look for more sources of corruption to blame. Eventually, they have to start purging their own ranks based on increasingly strict definitions of who truly belongs there, leading to infighting and eventual collapse.<br /> <br /> In the real world, groups that attach themselves to pagan identities may do so because they place the beginning of their decline at the point of their society's conversion to Christianity, which they identify as a foreign element that's incompatible with their natural character. (It's a lot more complicated than that, but bear with me.) In The World, they may still do that, but the continued worship of other Gods makes it a more difficult case to make. You can't say &quot;Everything was better when we had temples to Zeus&quot; when there are still temples to Zeus around.<br /> <br /> So what do they do? Go back a step further and treat the established pantheons as the foreign element that overturned the &quot;real&quot; original culture: worship of the Titans. (This only works for pantheons that have a mythology of the current generation of Gods overthrowing a previous one, of course.) In the Titanomachy book, there's a mention under the Followers section of Birthrights that Titans and their Scions often encourage revisionist groups who try to paint the Titans in a more positive light. These are exactly the sort of groups that would be part of the sort of far-right movements that you're talking about here.<br /> <br /> They'd still act more or less the same as real-world movements do, but the target of their hostility would change. These Gods, they would say, have failed us over and over again, because they're not the ones we're supposed to worship. They've lied to us, made us weak, and been responsible for our losses. It's time to recognize that they are as foreign to us as any religion that came later, and drive them out.<br /> <br /> And just like in the real world, there would be people who make this argument under the guise of scholarship. They would look at the clash of Titans and Gods and interpret it (very convincingly to their audience) as a battle between the native pantheon of a culture and invading outsiders. They would look at archaeological evidence to show that some religious practices fell out of favour as worship of the Gods arose, and try to revivify those practices under the guise of being more authentic to their people.<br /> <br /> This would be the more reputable face of the movement, the one that would probably be ignored outside of academic circles. The one that would completely deny that it had any influence on the mobs who went around burning temples of the Gods. The one whose books would find their way into the homes of leaders of those mobs, whose podcasts they'd listen to, and whose web forums they'd visit.<br /> <br /> Anyhow. That should be enough to get you started. My own opinion on the matter is, honestly, the same as the one that <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2142_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2142\" data-vbnamecard=\"2142\">Kyman201</a> offered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Scion 2E</b> Freelancer: <i>Origin; Hero; Demigod; God; Mythical Denizens; Mysteries of the World; Saints &amp; Monsters; No Gods, No Masters; Once &amp; Future, Realms of Magic &amp; Mystery</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":22}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/369-geoffrey","name":"Geoffrey","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T07:22:24-07:00","id":1420817,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420803#post1420803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I run game on <b>Discord </b>- and made special channel on our server for consent and game health issues. #Game-<a href=\"http://&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Occupational_safety_and_health&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">OSH</a><br /> I already mentioned the planed issue before to all my player - half of them already said in favour of it. We will see.<br /> <br /> But I started topic even to make general talk about Alt-Right idea in <b>Scion</b> universe, either way\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>If all (not just half) of your players are into it then go for it. It\u2019s your table dude.<br /> <br /> Also <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/369-geoffrey\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"369\" data-vbnamecard=\"369\">Geoffrey</a> I Liked your post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25665,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 10-29-2020, 10:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T09:13:43-07:00","id":1420835,"title":"","content":"I agree with Kyman mostly. If nazis appear in my game then it'll be because they're lesser mooks and the gods would respond to their entreaties by thinking &quot;Y'know, I saw that old Indiana Jones movie them mortals made a while back, I'll bet I can do better than simple melty-face!&quot; I can just see Odin saying that thoughtfully with a horn of mead in his hand...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T09:20:09-07:00","id":1420837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aristarkos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420774#post1420774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would not think it would be impossible for gods to mistakenly grant a request once in a while to hateful, horrible people. It would not exactly be the first time such things happened.</div> </div> </div> </div>While not impossible, my counter-argument still boils down to &quot;Fuck Nazis, I'm not giving them any vindication&quot;. I'll admit that it's not impossible that in history, there were people who learned secrets from the Aesir that went on to join the Nazis. But I'm under no obligation to acknowledge this for the sake of my games.<br /> <br /> This is how I deal with things. I'm not going to make any member of the Alt-Right or any Actual Literal Nazis feel like they're legitimate. I'm not going to make them feel like a threat. I'm not going to give any modern Nazi or Nazi sympathizer any kind of vindication by implying that they have ANY claim at all to the Aesir. They're Nazis. They don't get to have any claim on the Aesir or Runes or the All-Father. I'm not going to give them an inch, not going to give them any satisfaction of &quot;Yes I am a powerful threat that is a menace, I'm dangerous&quot;. I'm not going to acknowledge any kind of claim of legitimacy.<br /> <br /> That's why I recommended making them pathetic. Because most Alt-Right groups are made up of pathetic hateful people who thrive on a self-projected martyr complex. Making them a legitimate threat would be vindicating to them. Implying that they have the favor of ANY god is vindicating to them.<br /> <br /> They ain't getting that from me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T09:25:11-07:00","id":1420839,"title":"","content":"I feel like Nazis are a lot easier to do in a origins tier game because if you go hero then well you've got to figure out some excuse for there to be a nazi with power that makes them worth being a threat and then that requires a lot of caution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26499-bluishpurple","name":"bluishpurple","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T09:31:00-07:00","id":1420840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bluishpurple</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420839#post1420839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like Nazis are a lot easier to do in a origins tier game because if you go hero then well you've got to figure out some excuse for there to be a nazi with power that makes them worth being a threat and then that requires a lot of caution.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean maybe, but in this world Alt Right assholes are such cowards you have supposed big members of their circles afraid that people are gonna dump MILKSHAKES on them, or toss eggs. And like, they'd have to go get their suits dry-cleaned.<br /> <br /> Edit: Okay, why I keep going on about why I would make them pathetic... Brief tangent: There's a cartoon that was made as North Korean propaganda called Squirrel and Hedgehog. You can look it up but there's only one thing that I'm gonna focus on.<br /> <br /> There are expies of Americans in this cartoon, and the writers of this cartoon decided to portray the Americans as giant wolves with laser eyes, that carry entire miniguns on their person, who are strong enough to lift and throw tanks, who dress in sharp uniforms, fly about in giant eagle-shaped planes, and have <i>laser eyes</i>.<br /> <br /> The IMPORTANT thing is that many Americans, when they find out about this, respond with &quot;Wait they portray Americans like that? We're AWESOME!&quot;<br /> <br /> So yeah, I'd rather avoid making Nazis and other Alt-Right members enough of a legitimate threat to Heroes that anybody who potentially sees my game logs go &quot;Wait they made someone like me a super Sorcerer who commands animated soldiers?! AWESOME!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 10-29-2020, 12:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T13:15:14-07:00","id":1420860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bluishpurple</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420839#post1420839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like Nazis are a lot easier to do in a origins tier game because if you go hero then well you've got to figure out some excuse for there to be a nazi with power that makes them worth being a threat and then that requires a lot of caution.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I <i>exactly</i> plan Origin tier now - and using modern Thule as 'alt-right' that is conned by Scion of Loki ( SoL in short ) for this - sounds to me perfect. At the Hero level, we go for the SoL theyself - eschewing Thule as his stupid dupes only, they use them, just to have money and resources.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-29-2020, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T13:30:51-07:00","id":1420863,"title":"","content":"Has anyone here read David Brin's <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thor_Meets_Captain_America\" target=\"_blank\">Thor Meets Captain America</a>? It's what immediately jumped to mind when I read the premise of this topic. <br /> <br /> Ironically, the story in question did exactly what Kyman201 recommends: the actual Nazis who appeared in the story ended up getting mocked by the American captain, who pointed out that they weren't in charge of the Aesir, or even allies of the Aesir; they had become minions of the Aesir.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T14:07:34-07:00","id":1420866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bluishpurple</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420839#post1420839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like Nazis are a lot easier to do in a origins tier game because if you go hero then well you've got to figure out some excuse for there to be a nazi with power that makes them worth being a threat and then that requires a lot of caution.</div> </div> </div> </div>A band of Heroes could still have a challenge with a single fanatical / desperate neo-nazi. I'm imagining for example getting some vague hints that some lone alt-right / neo-nazi / Incel person is planning a killing spree or terrorist attack like Anders Breivik or Elliot Rodgers did, and that the band of Heroes must track this would-be killer down and stop them.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure I would be comfortable running or participating in that game though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T16:40:08-07:00","id":1420889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aristarkos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420866#post1420866\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A band of Heroes could still have a challenge with a single fanatical / desperate neo-nazi. I'm imagining for example getting some vague hints that some lone alt-right / neo-nazi / Incel person is planning a killing spree or terrorist attack like Anders Breivik or Elliot Rodgers did, and that the band of Heroes must track this would-be killer down and stop them.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure I would be comfortable running or participating in that game though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I wouldn't run that in a million years because people like THEM want to be immortalized and remembered for their rampages. They're best left forgotten. By even taking inspiration from them, I'd be indirectly giving them what they want.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T16:47:50-07:00","id":1420890,"title":"","content":"On the other hand, you also don't want to pretend that they don't exist. I think the recent Book of the Fallen for Mage hit the right note here: acknowledge that evil exists, and even that it can be dangerous; but make an effort not to glamorize it. Instead, focus on identifying and combating it. <br /> <br /> Nothing good ever comes from ignoring something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T17:57:09-07:00","id":1420900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420837#post1420837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While not impossible, my counter-argument still boils down to &amp;quot;Fuck Nazis, I'm not giving them any vindication&amp;quot;. I'll admit that it's not impossible that in history, there were people who learned secrets from the Aesir that went on to join the Nazis. But I'm under no obligation to acknowledge this for the sake of my games.<br /> <br /> This is how I deal with things. I'm not going to make any member of the Alt-Right or any Actual Literal Nazis feel like they're legitimate. I'm not going to make them feel like a threat. I'm not going to give any modern Nazi or Nazi sympathizer any kind of vindication by implying that they have ANY claim at all to the Aesir. They're Nazis. They don't get to have any claim on the Aesir or Runes or the All-Father. I'm not going to give them an inch, not going to give them any satisfaction of &amp;quot;Yes I am a powerful threat that is a menace, I'm dangerous&amp;quot;. I'm not going to acknowledge any kind of claim of legitimacy.<br /> <br /> That's why I recommended making them pathetic. Because most Alt-Right groups are made up of pathetic hateful people who thrive on a self-projected martyr complex. Making them a legitimate threat would be vindicating to them. Implying that they have the favor of ANY god is vindicating to them.<br /> <br /> They ain't getting that from me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I never thought about it like this but after thinking about it I totally agree with you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T18:14:56-07:00","id":1420910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420890#post1420890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the other hand, you also don't want to pretend that they don't exist. I think the recent Book of the Fallen for Mage hit the right note here: acknowledge that evil exists, and even that it can be dangerous; but make an effort not to glamorize it. Instead, focus on identifying and combating it.<br /> <br /> Nothing good ever comes from ignoring something.</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps, but I'm fully aware that they exist. I just run and play games to... Relax? Have fun? I don't find anything FUN with using them. I don't even really enjoy making them eat pavement because it reminds me that I can't smite them in real life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T19:15:48-07:00","id":1420918,"title":"","content":"Fair enough. Though really, what is roleplaying if not a means of doing things that you can't in real life? <br /> <br /> I'm not saying that you're wrong to do it the way you do; it's just that <i>your</i> posts have been coming across as \u201cit's wrong to feature them\u201d, and I wanted to add a little balance to the discussion. <br /> <br /> In that regard, the issue is \u201cif you're going to include them, what are the pitfalls to avoid and how do you avoid them?\u201d <br /> <br /> One pitfall to avoid is getting them wrong. For instance, it's all too easy to conflate \u201cAlt-Right\u201d with \u201cconservative\u201d or even \u201cnot Progressive\u201d, and portraying people who <i>aren't</i> Alt-right as of they were. For instance, if your idea of an Alt-righter is a Trump supporter (a very common portrayal these days), you need to look into the Alt-right a bit more closely, not to mention Trump supporters. The two groups are actually at odds with each other, despite a general perception to the contrary. <br /> <br /> In short, if you're going to punch Nazis in the face, make sure they <i>are</i> Nazis before you start swinging. <br /> <br /> Second, you're definitely right about the possibility of portraying Nazis and their ilk as more of a threat than they are. I generally don't use Alt-righters as serious villains because, frankly, they're not dangerous enough. They're a small, fringe faction that practically everyone who isn't them condemns, more of an irritant than a threat. You'd <i>need</i> something like the aforementioned <i>Thor Meets Captain America</i> before they become a credible danger; and even then, it would be the gods they summon, not the people who did the summoning, who would be the real danger. <br /> <br /> Indeed, the genesis of the story in question was that when its author was asked to write a story for an alternate history anthology dedicated to scenarios where the Nazis won, he initially turned it down because he considered the premise ludicrous: the Nazis only got as far as they did because of a few lucky breaks on their part, and it would have taken quite a few more in order for them to have actually won. He was challenged to find a premise that would work, and this story was the result. <br /> <br /> In the context of <b>Scion</b>, the question that would have to be asked is \u201cwhich gods would actually support them?\u201d And to my mind, the real hurdle there isn't ethical; <i>all</i> of the existing Pantheons are filled with gods who are far from being pillars of virtue. Indeed, there's a sort of ethnic bias built into the Pantheons by virtue of them being derived from cultural mythologies: they're going to tend to favor mortals aligned with the culture that they came from. <br /> <br /> No, the hurdle is a very practical one: given how weak and ineffective the Alt-right is, they don't really have anything to offer. Nor are they a group that anyone would take pity on, as they're in no way victims. I'd personally have to set the game in World War II, when the Nazis actually looked powerful, to get a scenario where I could picture any gods (other than malicious tricksters) supporting them. I'd even have trouble getting Titans to back them outside of such a scenario.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 10-30-2020, 12:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T01:48:35-07:00","id":1420946,"title":"","content":"In Poland, we are governed by Catholic Fasists that totally ban abortion and declare LGBT+ as not humans. I REALLY like to punch some 'Alt-righters' in my RPG, right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-30-2020, 05:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T02:20:52-07:00","id":1420950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1420946#post1420946\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In Poland, we are governed by Catholic Fasists that totally ban abortion and declare LGBT+ as npt humans. I REALLY like to punch some 'Alt-righters' in my RPG, right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Very understandable, and I want to make clear again that I don't have anything against the concept as such, I was just voicing how <i>I</i> would feel in such a game. My heart goes out to Poland and I hope that you folks over there can return to full freedom and democracy soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10624-sacerdos","name":"Sacerdos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10624_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"231"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T04:24:52-07:00","id":1420957,"title":"","content":"As someone who lost whole branches of my family to Nazis, I would rather they only exist in a Scion game as the cowardly dead.<br /> <br /> Murderers used by the nastier sorts of gods as creatures rather than honored in any way. Any status among such cursed dead should be a demented, sad shadow. Like shambling, hungry dead saluting each other, despite their arms falling off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":1756,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","user":"MythAdvocate","date":". 10-31-2020, 12:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-04T12:21:28-08:00","id":1421830,"title":"","content":"I ran a Scion 1e campaign a few years ago, and the first chapter was set in Berlin. The Berlin Fashion Weekend turned from a public spectacle to a public cluster**** as three separate sets of cultists got the bright idea to start killing random people as a terrorist attack - at the same time. Naturally, they wound up killing each other more than they killed civilians, allowing the player characters to completely wipe out one group of their choice before the other two escaped. Now, two of those groups were regular Titanspawn cultists - one led by one of Fenris' cubs, and the other by one of Jormungandr's brood. They were normal, unaugmented humans, each led by a monster. (One of the players was also a Scion of Loki, turning the entite thing into a demented family feud.) The third group were actual Neo-Nazis, without any supernatural backing whatsoever. They did wound up the biggest threat, though, not due to any monsters, divine gifts, or magic relics, but because they got their hands on a WW2 relic - the remains of a half-finished German nuke. The players loved bashing the Nazis, but the main aesop was the same thing White Wolf used to have as their default stance on supernaturals in WW2 - sometimes evil is all too human.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26101-grevnor","name":"Grevnor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-11T07:41:03-08:00","id":1423051,"title":"","content":"In the history of my World, Divius Julius was behind the Thule Society, a cult that was one part social club and one part reliquarians. They were interested in the Saxon gods, not the Aesir directly, they desired and venerated the power of the Saxon gods and didn't really worship them. Divius Julius' mantles and scions steered the Thule Society in the directions it needed to steal secrets and relics from the Saxon gods. He gave them the promise of power by convincing them they can master the powers of the gods, but assured the path they went down was a self-destructive one.<br /> <br /> Divius Julius has a big grudge against the German people and does what he can to screw with them.<br /> <br /> Although members of the Thule Society were part of the Nazi party, Hitler wasn't and they had little control over the Nazi party. Hitler tolerated their existence because occasionally they were useful. Hitler was a mortal who didn't give a shit about any gods unless he could use them to advance his cause.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-11T13:44:18-08:00","id":1423107,"title":"","content":"in 1e, the axis pantheons were all tricked. they thought they could break fate. also, they didn't have there usual leaders, except the kami of course, but i think they suffered a collective insanity like the japanese did. in 1e, loki got control of the aseir and caligula impersonated zeus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-11T15:28:23-08:00","id":1423122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423107#post1423107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">in 1e, the axis pantheons were all tricked. they thought they could break fate. also, they didn't have there usual leaders, except the kami of course, but i think they suffered a collective insanity like the japanese did. in 1e, loki got control of the aseir and caligula impersonated zeus.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that was... Uh, dumb? Like, I don't think you want to tell worshippers of the Aesir &quot;Your gods got conned and that's why they were onboard with the Nazis. Odin got outsmarted by Hilter and his stooges&quot;<br /> <br /> Yeah, no, I'm not gonna touch WW2 because I'm nowhere good enough to talk about that.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-11T20:36:51-08:00","id":1423173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423122#post1423122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, that was... Uh, dumb? Like, I don't think you want to tell worshippers of the Aesir &amp;quot;Your gods got conned and that's why they were onboard with the Nazis. Odin got outsmarted by Hilter and his stooges&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Yeah, no, I'm not gonna touch WW2 because I'm nowhere good enough to talk about that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, honestly the whole thing, while cool, was a big old what an idiot moment for the gods. The aseir trusted loki for cryin out loud.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-11T22:52:31-08:00","id":1423186,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423173#post1423173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, honestly the whole thing, while cool, was a big old what an idiot moment for the gods. The aseir trusted loki for cryin out loud.</div> </div> </div> </div>I uh, disagree that it was cool. It felt like the writers going for something they thought was cool and instead made the Aesir look like chumps. Which while not tonally inconsistent with other parts of 1e isn't something that should be continued, I think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T04:44:16-08:00","id":1423237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423186#post1423186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I uh, disagree that it was cool. It felt like the writers going for something they thought was cool and instead made the Aesir look like chumps. Which while not tonally inconsistent with other parts of 1e isn't something that should be continued, I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well ok. Thats your opinion. My opinion is that they should have detailed how the other pantheons handled the war. But i respect your opinion and i hope you can respect mine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T12:31:44-08:00","id":1423341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423237#post1423237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well ok. Thats your opinion. My opinion is that they should have detailed how the other pantheons handled the war. But i respect your opinion and i hope you can respect mine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay so, this is entirely me:<br /> <br /> Sometimes if you attribute everything to the Gods, you risk completely mystifying some <i>very human</i> wrongs. Like even 1e understood that, which is why it went 'But the Aesir had no idea that the Holocaust was even planned'. But it still kind of stumbled into things by having the Aesir plan to put Hitler in power for something something 'Changing Fatebindings'<br /> <br /> That kind of handwaves Hitler coming into power for very human reasons, taking advantage of tensions and hatreds at the time. Like, if you put a gun to my head and forced me to talk about the World Wars in Scion... I'd probably go with some 'The two wars were a surprise to many of the Gods, and some of them view the two as being basically one giant war with a break in the middle. The World Wars began for much the same reasons why both began in our world, and many Gods were taken utterly by surprise.'","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T13:04:20-08:00","id":1423347,"title":"","content":"There <i>is</i> something to be said for the notion that the gods' concerns aren't the same as man's concerns. I personally wouldn't phrase it in terms of the gods being caught by surprise; more like it was beneath their notice. Yes; two World Wars, both of which involved tremendous human deaths, were beneath their notice. The gods in <b>Scion</b> are not pillars of righteousness. For all we know, it's possible that in the World, Hitler <i>was</i> a Scion, and World War II was his bid for godhood, in much the same way as Caesar's campaign to exterminate the Nemontedavos. <br /> <br /> I do get your point about mythologizing very human evil; but I'll just note that part of the reason why <b>Scion</b>'s gods are so flawed is because they're reflections of <i>us</i>. If Hitler <i>was</i> a Scion, that merely illustrates that very human evil can be magnified by the path a Scion treads.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T13:05:31-08:00","id":1423348,"title":"","content":"People tend to use Nazis as stand-ins for '80s Satanists. That is, in pretty much any work of fiction, Nazis are doing evil things for no other reason than &quot;It's evil and we're Nazis.&quot; Even self-destructive things like poisoning the city they live in while they are in it or blowing up the Earth that they are standing on. Further, the only character trait they have is &quot;Nazi.&quot; They don't have any other motivations or vices. They can't be persuaded, convinced, manipulated, bribed, or threatened. They have no self-interest beyond doing what is most evil, including survival. They can't even pretend to be good because that wouldn't be the most evil thing they can do. If they're not kicking a puppy, it's only because it would slow them down from blowing up a hospital. They'll come back and kick the puppy later.<br /> <br /> And they can never, ever be redeemed. They can't even pretend to be redeemed. They have no capacity for redemption because they cannot do anything beyond seek out evil to do. Because of this, if you introduce Nazi characters that aren't robotically pursuing evil acts for the purpose of evil acts, it creates an uncomfortable and irrational disconnect. This is why they make bad characters in games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26003-richard-the-lyin-heart","name":"Richard the Lyin' Heart","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T13:15:26-08:00","id":1423350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423341#post1423341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay so, this is entirely me:<br /> <br /> Sometimes if you attribute everything to the Gods, you risk completely mystifying some <i>very human</i> wrongs. Like even 1e understood that, which is why it went 'But the Aesir had no idea that the Holocaust was even planned'. But it still kind of stumbled into things by having the Aesir plan to put Hitler in power for something something 'Changing Fatebindings'<br /> <br /> That kind of handwaves Hitler coming into power for very human reasons, taking advantage of tensions and hatreds at the time. Like, if you put a gun to my head and forced me to talk about the World Wars in Scion... I'd probably go with some 'The two wars were a surprise to many of the Gods, and some of them view the two as being basically one giant war with a break in the middle. The World Wars began for much the same reasons why both began in our world, and many Gods were taken utterly by surprise.'</div> </div> </div> </div>personally i see the asier as being like the german citizens. ie, they were completely fooled by hitler and never knew the holocaust was a thing. hitler was a human, plain and simple. the asier were like the germans, they got caught up in the ferver and never saw the monster he really was until after his death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T13:26:17-08:00","id":1423352,"title":"","content":"I mean... I\u2019m fine with that. Screw \u2018em.<br /> <br /> Yeah there\u2019s something to be said for acknowledging that many of those within Nazi Germant were normal people suffering from their material conditions who probably didn\u2019t understand the full scope of the atrocities that they were party to... but the idea that people couldn\u2019t tell at the time that something was wrong isn\u2019t really true. The Nazis arrested and executed protestors who rejected their rule and their behavior was far beyond the norm. It wasn\u2019t just part of the times.<br /> <br /> So sure, there\u2019s merit to showing reasonably human characters that were indoctrinated by and became themselves victims of fascism, but that\u2019s not an excuse or justification. At the most charitable, it\u2019s a reason and it makes them somewhat pitiable. However anyone who is a nazi is evil as far as I\u2019m concerned and I don\u2019t have any issue showing them as pure villains, because that\u2019s what they are.<br /> <br /> If they realize the error of their ways, forswear their former actions and associations, and actively seek to make amends I\u2019d be willing to see them be redeemed. But anyway who is currently a fascist is fundamentally a villain and a threat to society and humanity, so I have no issue rejecting them in the strongest possible terms.<br /> <br /> Plus, pulps have a lot of bad stuff associated with them, but say what you will, there will always be something satisfying about being able to punch nazis<br /> <br /> As far as the gods, I can understand thematic arguments for a number of perspectives, but I agree with most people who\u2019ve posted above. The gods operate under their own terms, although connected with the terms of their society and culture. They could be apathetic, surprised, disinterested, or what have you.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s a nuanced subject and I think plenty of people above make good points but I do ultimately want to agree on this point at least: fascists get nothing unless they forsake fascism and there\u2019s something quite enjoyable about getting to play a hero who punches fascists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T13:54:33-08:00","id":1423362,"title":"","content":"A key part of what Richard the Lyin' Heart was saying, though, is that Nazis aren't just portrayed as evil; they're also portrayed as <i>stupidly</i> evil. It isn't about making them sympathetic; it's about the fact that the ones you really have to worry about are the ones you don't see coming, because they are so good at pretending that they have your best interests at heart \u2014 <i>and</i> they're very good at setting up scapegoats. Like I said in my first post to this thread, before you go punching fascists in the face, make sure that they are in fact fascists: it may turn out that they are in fact <i>scapegoats</i>, and that by punching them in the face you're actually facilitating in the <i>real</i> fascists. <br /> <br /> In Nazi Germany, Germans didn't go after Jews because they had hatred in their hearts; they went after the Jews because they were sold on the notion that there was a Jewish conspiracy that was responsible for their woes. To them, the <i>Jews</i> were the fascists (well, not literally; Fascism was an Italian thing; but I hope you get my point), and deserved everything that they got: it was a matter of justice. To say that they should have known better is to risk falling into the same trap.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T23:38:53-08:00","id":1423480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423350#post1423350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">personally i see the asier as being like the german citizens. ie, they were completely fooled by hitler and never knew the holocaust was a thing. hitler was a human, plain and simple. the asier were like the germans, they got caught up in the ferver and never saw the monster he really was until after his death.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you look at my earlier post, you'll see me explain why this characterisation of the German populace during the Third Reich is deeply wrong and revisionist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10624-sacerdos","name":"Sacerdos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10624_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"231"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T23:45:41-08:00","id":1423481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Richard the Lyin' Heart</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423348#post1423348\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">People tend to use Nazis as stand-ins for '80s Satanists. That is, in pretty much any work of fiction, Nazis are doing evil things for no other reason than &quot;It's evil and we're Nazis.&quot; Even self-destructive things like poisoning the city they live in while they are in it or blowing up the Earth that they are standing on. Further, the only character trait they have is &quot;Nazi.&quot; They don't have any other motivations or vices. They can't be persuaded, convinced, manipulated, bribed, or threatened. They have no self-interest beyond doing what is most evil, including survival. They can't even pretend to be good because that wouldn't be the most evil thing they can do. If they're not kicking a puppy, it's only because it would slow them down from blowing up a hospital. They'll come back and kick the puppy later.<br /> <br /> And they can never, ever be redeemed. They can't even pretend to be redeemed. They have no capacity for redemption because they cannot do anything beyond seek out evil to do. Because of this, if you introduce Nazi characters that aren't robotically pursuing evil acts for the purpose of evil acts, it creates an uncomfortable and irrational disconnect. This is why they make bad characters in games.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I couldn't care less whether bleeping <i>Nazis</i> are complex characters, because newsflash, yes, Nazis <i>were</i> pure evil. Evil isn't defined by kicking puppies, but if you try to look for the agonising complexities in the character of people who killed literally 8 million innocents for no other reason than because they deemed them inferior, who literally killed for sport, who played arts and crafts with corpses, then I think you are really coming at this from the wrong side. And yes, they were at times self-destructive about it. The persecution of Jewish people led to a massive brain drain that we all still feel today, because it was the enormous amount of talent that fled to the USA that so firmly put them in the lead globally where science, arts, etc. are concerned. Hitler ordered his armies, including forcibly conscripted child soldiers, to fight to the last man when the Allies were marching on Berlin. He was willing to let every last man of his &quot;chosen people&quot; die because they had disappointed him in losing the war. Many officers went along with this. They <i>were</i> self-destructive and ultimately purposeless in their evil, and that is the whole point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10624-sacerdos","name":"Sacerdos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10624_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"231"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T23:54:29-08:00","id":1423483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420772-villains-gods-and-alt-right?p=1423362#post1423362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A key part of what Richard the Lyin' Heart was saying, though, is that Nazis aren't just portrayed as evil; they're also portrayed as <i>stupidly</i> evil. It isn't about making them sympathetic; it's about the fact that the ones you really have to worry about are the ones you don't see coming, because they are so good at pretending that they have your best interests at heart \u2014 <i>and</i> they're very good at setting up scapegoats. Like I said in my first post to this thread, before you go punching fascists in the face, make sure that they are in fact fascists: it may turn out that they are in fact <i>scapegoats</i>, and that by punching them in the face you're actually facilitating in the <i>real</i> fascists.<br /> <br /> In Nazi Germany, Germans didn't go after Jews because they had hatred in their hearts; they went after the Jews because they were sold on the notion that there was a Jewish conspiracy that was responsible for their woes. To them, the <i>Jews</i> were the fascists (well, not literally; Fascism was an Italian thing; but I hope you get my point), and deserved everything that they got: it was a matter of justice. To say that they should have known better is to risk falling into the same trap.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really don't want to reply to this, but I replied to the two others, so I feel I have to. Like, Data, I wanna give you the benefit of the doubt, but holy shit, this is stuff I hear from neo-Nazi rallies. This is stuff I'd probably report as incitement under German law if I heard it over here. You are literally making excuses for the perpetrators of the Shoah. Find me a hatred that does <i>not</i> clothe itself in a rhetoric of justice. There's no difference. Of course people back then hated Jews, hated them irrationally, passionately, and sure, in their eyes, justly. The Shoah wasn't about preventing a conspiracy, it wasn't about justice, it was about <i>eradication</i>. Look at my earlier explanation that I linked to. Literal children were writing about how Jewish people were vermin to be exterminated. No, I am <i>not</i> falling into the &quot;same trap&quot; of literal Nazism by insisting that my ancestors should have known better, that they should have resisted, should have refused to collaborate. Saying that there is no room for Nazis in our modern society and neither in the games I play is emphatically <i>not</i> the same as being a Nazi. To call the &quot;scapegoating&quot; of neo-Nazis equivalent to the scapegoating of Jewish people by those same Nazis is ... honestly, I'm at a lack of words. Seriously rethink your reasoning there, Data, please. I want to believe that you're better than Holocaust apologism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10624-sacerdos","name":"Sacerdos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10624_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"231"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T23:59:30-08:00","id":1423484,"title":"","content":"Something people tend to forget is that awful people and philosophies tend to be self-destructive, cause if you encourage people to be awful and to look out only for themselves and their own political power, you tend to get a bunch of people more willing to backstab each other for short term gain then working together. Edit: also people were anti-Semitic before Hitler came along, why do you think Hitler got into power in the first place? Cause he invoked the already present hatred for minorities especially Jews that was super common in the country and well most of the world (and honestly is still pretty damn popular even if it has taken other forms)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24769,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24769-magicjohnny","user":"Magicjohnny","date":". 11-13-2020, 03:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24769-magicjohnny","name":"Magicjohnny","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24769_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-13T02:24:06-08:00","id":1423498,"title":"","content":"During session 0 and pre-game planning, I like to mention that any NPC sporting nazi paraphernalia or ideology might as well be wearing a huge sign that says &quot;PUNCH ME&quot;<br /> <br /> Is it nuanced? No. But I'll save my nuance for literally anything else. Fuck every nazi, forever and ever, amen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23975-pxgentleman","name":"PXGentleman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-13T03:24:36-08:00","id":1423506,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Okay, it doesn't take a genius to note this thread was a terrible idea to begin. It is being shut down. I went to bed and it had 90 complaints when I woke up.<br /> <br /> Actions will be taken on certain posters but to clarify this forums official policy on it: Yes, Nazis are THAT bad.<br /> <br /> The Holocaust was not done as part of some well-intentioned or misguided quest to save the world, it was a genocide against real people by guys who decided killing people by the millions was great. Fuck those guys and anyone who tries to frame it as anything other than among the worst things,if not the worst thing, ever done by anyone.<br /> <br /> Also, fuck anyone who defends it. They have no place on these forums.<br /> <br /> Zero tolerance policy. </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 11-13-2020, 06:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}